fr","original_title":"Le Château de verre","overview":"Evelyne jest żoną Laurenta, szwajcarskiego sędziego, jest szczęśliwa. Spotyka jednak Rémy’ego i czuje nieodparte zainteresowanie. Na jego prośbę wyjeżdża na dwadzieścia cztery godziny do Paryża. Początkowo niepewnie Evelyne i Rémy w końcu przeżywają romantyczny, wymarzony dzień, który kończy się nocą w hotelu. Pożegnania przeciągają się, Evelyne spóźnia się na pociąg i wsiada do samolotu, aby wrócić do domu.","popularity":1.3103,"poster_path":"/yibNaLMD9voPl13y00eAkjw6nkq.jpg","release_date":"1950-12-16","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.8,"vote_count":16,"character":"Un voyageur qui sort de la Gare de l'Est (uncredited)","credit_id":"62118355a84ff7006d23b718","order":20},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":1142575,"title":"Carl Th. Dreyer und Gertrud","original_language":"da","original_title":"Carl Th. Dreyer und Gertrud","overview":"","popularity":0.4015,"poster_path":null,"release_date":"1994-06-11","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0,"character":"","credit_id":"6491b8782f8d09011d25e3d4","order":1},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/3fQDbggJOWl1rE6ehQWFJ4hphFz.jpg","genre_ids":[18],"id":89494,"title":"Vladimir et Rosa","original_language":"fr","original_title":"Vladimir et Rosa","overview":"","popularity":1.1406,"poster_path":"/7E0HZylp5wjiWlOtFez9O7XKT62.jpg","release_date":"1971-04-16","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.647,"vote_count":17,"character":"Vladimir Lenin (uncredited)","credit_id":"52fe4a1c9251416c910c39e9","order":3},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/vqrpj0YSx1kWyEngC85jsMJepNp.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":104951,"title":"Lettre à Freddy Buache","original_language":"fr","original_title":"Lettre à Freddy Buache","overview":"","popularity":0.528,"poster_path":"/bi3xED8eEo8gOrlhODzsCxHgA4m.jpg","release_date":"1983-06-24","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.25,"vote_count":10,"character":"Self (uncredited)","credi